                "fallback": "#trustbeyondborders #globalbusiness #makeinternationalgreatagain | iBanFirst",
                "text": "Make International Great Again! :globe_with_meridians:\n \nIt’s a stand we assume at iBanFirst to defend international business against protectionism. \nIt’s not just a slogan we decided to hijack.\nIt&amp;#39;s not just our new communication campaign.\n \nAt a time when tariffs are spreading across the world, we stand by what we believe: an open world where bold companies can do fair business without burdens. \n \nThat’s why, since 2016, we’ve been building a new standard for international payments.\n \nTogether with thousands of forward-thinking CEOs and businesses who dare to go global, we’ll keep paving the way to “Make International Great Again!” \n \n#TrustBeyondBorders #GlobalBusiness #MakeInternationalGreatAgain",
